"role.tanukiClone.name" : "Clone"
"role.tanukiClone.short" : "Clone"
"role.tanukiClone.blurb" : "Another you walks with your voice."
"role.tanukiClone.generalBlurb" : "Another you walks with your voice."
"role.tanukiClone.doc" : "A Crewmate role, also assignable to Madmates.<br>Record your voice for ten seconds, then summon one clone with your appearance and name.<br>The clone walks around automatically and loops the recording to nearby players."
"role.tanukiClone.tips" : "・When enabled, audible clone speech lights up the owner's talking indicator for each listener. Silent parts do not light it up.<br>・Press Record, then Summon once the ten-second recording finishes.<br>・Only one clone can exist per owner. The summon cooldown starts when it disappears.<br>・A kill removes only the clone, never its owner. Meetings, owner death or disconnect, and role removal also remove it.<br>・Recording again removes the current clone and overwrites the old recording. A meeting cancels an unfinished recording; completed recordings survive meetings.<br>・Clones do not count as players or tasks.<br>・Requires compatible development versions of TanukiBCL. Audio stays in memory on each connected client; clients that missed capture cannot recover past audio."
"options.role.tanukiClone.detail" : "Summon an automatically walking clone that loops ten seconds of your voice."
"options.role.tanukiClone.cooldown" : "Cooldown after clone disappears"
"options.role.tanukiClone.spoofTalking" : "Show clone speech as the owner's talking indicator"
"options.role.tanukiClone.range" : "Clone voice range"
"button.label.tanukiClone.record" : "Record"
"button.label.tanukiClone.recording" : "Recording"
"button.label.tanukiClone.summon" : "Summon"
